{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/885COntUK0azGHcV7LYBKw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.801239+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/885COntUK0azGHcV7LYBKw","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0sZtLYG4T3wiatxDiaHjicfnTxzPN8r0RFZzicxAM5QQvSdiawJEHiczwjPw3ibTx0uicmweExJu0cHTngwUxV5KWPJXXvG3Dpia16zHsQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t27icWUg1uiaicWB2H6icJYQSa3dCQenqWS5Yib6F5ULZUtOLeD9E7aAfia4OhPMFTHGCq9SayNByzPSwOHHxz632oPvSFGSzgRmBPFE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t37mAMickbibFx6lEN2KscKdA91CiaXqd1fGDUaqYVe9uLwtZOt35lAMdjYd9DSSbVOzqTwgM3iczcFHFWaZZCanfewC9rPgT4QL14/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>南京理工大学经济管理学院</span></strong></span><span>前身是1980年由原第五机械工业部在华东工程学院（南京理工大学前身）组建的企业领导干部进修系，翌年更名为管理工程系，1991年7月组建成立了经济管理学院。</span></p><p><span>学院学科实力突出，由学院主建的“一般社会科学”“经济与商学”两个学科先后进入ESI世界前1%。学院有“企业大数据质量管理与风险控制工业和信息化部重点实验室”“江苏产业集群决策咨询研究基地”“江苏省科技人才思想库”“江苏省高端装备质量提升工程研究中心”等5个省级平台，拥有“国际经贸问题研究中心”“社会计算与舆情分析研究基地”2个省级研究基地培育点。</span></p><p><span>学院拥有国家万人计划哲学社会科学领军人才</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家文化名家暨“四个一批”人才</span><em><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong></em><span>人、国家万人计划青年拔尖人才</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、国家优秀青年基金项目获得者</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人（含国家海外高层次人才</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人）、爱思唯尔（Elsevier）“中国高被引学者”</span><strong><em><span><span>5</span></span></em></strong><span>人、科睿唯安（Clarivate）“高被引科学家”</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、财政部全国会计领军人才</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省特聘教授</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省青蓝工程人才/江苏省</span><strong><em><span><span>333</span></span></em></strong><span>工程人才等数</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省紫金文化优青</span><strong><em><span><span>4</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省社科英才</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>人、江苏省教学名师</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>人，江苏省双创博士</span><strong><em><span><span>21</span></span></em></strong><span>人等。学院有在站全职博士后</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>人，</span><strong><em><span><span>1</span></span></em></strong><span>个省级优秀教学团队。</span></p><p><span>学院坚持</span><span><strong><span>“依托理工背景、面向社会发展、彰显军工特色”</span></strong></span><span>的办学定位，秉承</span><strong><span><span>“凝聚产生力量，整合创造未来”</span></span></strong><span>的精神，为党育英才、为国铸利器。</span></p><p><span>学院的建设目标是：将学院建设成为特色鲜明、结构合理、制度先进、综合办学实力与办学水平稳步提升，在国内外同类院校中有较高知名度和影响力的高水平研究型学院。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0vn0jGlyAHt74IBZ00PEiaYZibxGlIeTicSGiaAFxcMoH49UDmloJ4413sM17EgDpN4AeXbeTSkYnSxjBF46nYL7sBZ9AbmPygiaVA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2AcjqibOHAxPibxYJ4rpdFuggnXtdB3Wekl3yzkYxV8voDW8vPLrZWwAJzuJykqn0ha05iaghg4vVfibrGHia5bAS4b8xxEicwroKNk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3SW3UjokGFoqqSmAOvBPicRrpGwVRibkepS8ibSvL6CqDjtqWxXDk28ia6VmyD9sxXUhNibDaArnqgyZyk9HKZxoKlaF9SJaaNxib6U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3b1MN4dmQWaoibJibWiacyYhrnwrM2aBpT0xJEovb3sliagSziaBeH1bpEINDCvTS8kmWFIPX4UMIgT3nwicia0NhQ7ZSC7vMuVWT2MQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3ofcpGKia9SxtqkPsSs6zZhal3H0bia6smsWticrG3greAnRBf7IXeBddK0Fu45rxUFd2ZiaU3DhpEK15ef9nZqvg6oZLCa2yuD1E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1eA30rRk3uH0rkEbvlUsEFRuMOpb5b7dz0ak68f36ORLAqLicdEnEIhVfaEgomS51sMwAZcfXmhvuJ4CQZyy23Lt2nhMKYXmwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3UjK00DG0hdeY4WnFU4iasDcQO7EXJPWzhh9FU3EMLSL7C0I2U0xuAcu535RrtQTw35YyfgLOjpVN9KWLjln0OmCF6vTexh4v8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>根据实际情况设置</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月5日至7月15日（不在时间范围内的申请无效）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2027年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（附四、六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业与本院招生专业相近，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>5</span></strong></span><strong><span>.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，学院筛选确定参会学生，将通过邮件统一通知申请人。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人在系统报名后，将申请表（在报名系统中填写后生成）、学生证和身份证、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明、其他证明材料（科研论文、获奖证书等），扫描为一个pdf。邮件和文件命名为\"申请xx专业+姓名+本科毕业学校\"，发至联系邮箱yz107@njust.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>【注：以上申请材料如有弄虚作假，一经发现立即取消相应资格】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>开放日期间举办学科和专业介绍、学术沙龙、在线交流等活动，具体以实际安排为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t04ibAe6uu7ibOfKTdMERfa0KbvjqbVZ9Yckhby82eaGM2gIyBtYWaHyETNg0BJHjtyUwsTKBbLJNd07gUWWwItEll1Js58z5Oec/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关时间及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>025-84304011</span></p><p><span>（工作日15:00-17:00）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>yz107@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>QQ群二维码</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3jRTibA1bXvlkiaiaez5toCibjvwWCR4KSqOibmhfOjZ6bJj9vLKs0HZn8BBvhYA42oBbEEAd3lLOkk4FwqjZdDWv5J4bfIw0t6mx8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>753499390</span></p><p><span>（经管院全日制研究生招生交流群）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1X8njF7zN3jHSQzKq53sKJ6S3BYf8SKcmrMIZFqDEQWeEzdaHrJTMTgicOy7BwbrrKTnN2dJH7AsWMEAjW3GK4ARhD9v0iaIVts/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 经济管理学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 经济管理学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t021XMiagE0Jsb1KvGJZJPNlG31zbTXVx9Yz01DhngKNIXPpOtXPgGp5gI9hBibXyibJF91lXcictT7HfGjnue6okibGt28rqjtcvBA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"384161dbcdee20138d89140741ffb2a1bed3e6bcab847416da5aa8abc226c250","textLength":1356,"sourceSha256":"7292ac082799486fa05a47f22ee03710b1f13570cf8c2a9399d42d3991e99206","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-17cac3b7ae0dc3659da7","title":"2026年南京理工大学经济管理学院2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.801239+00:00"}
